      "skeleton": "a Lion appeared and made no attempt to molest the Pack-Ass; but he fell upon the Wild Ass and made a meal of him.",
      "explanation": "사자의 행동이 차례로 나와요: 나타났다(appeared) → 짐 당나귀는 건드리지 않았다(made no attempt to ~) → 들당나귀를 덮쳤다(fell upon) → 잡아먹었다(made a meal of). make no attempt to ~는 '~하려는 시도를 전혀 하지 않다', owing to는 '~ 때문에'예요. who had no one to protect him은 들당나귀를 설명하는 관계대명사절이고, to protect him은 no one을 꾸미는 to부정사예요."
